              <td>Separate service fees</td>
              <td>
                <div class="fee-disclosure-list">
                  <span>Annual inspection <strong>$195</strong></span>
                  <span>Pre lease renewal / pre move out inspection <strong>$145</strong></span>
                  <span>Maintenance coordination <strong>$25/request</strong></span>
                </div>
              </td>
              <td><span class="fee-disclosure-muted">Not applicable</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="fee-comparison" class="section-soft">
    <div class="container reveal">
      <div class="section-head center">
        <div class="section-kicker">Fee Structure Comparison</div>
        <h2>How Red Door's Fee Structure Compares</h2>
        <p>Many property management companies advertise a low monthly rate but add multiple extra fees throughout the leasing and management process. Red Door's structure is designed to be clear, competitive, and value-driven.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fee-compare-graphic" aria-label="Industry standard versus Red Door fee structure comparison">
        <table class="fee-compare-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Fee or Service</th>
              <th>Industry Standard</th>
              <th>Red Door Structure</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Monthly Management</td>
              <td>A low advertised monthly rate may not include the full operating support owners expect.</td>
              <td><span class="red-door-answer"><span><strong>9%</strong> of monthly collected rent for full-service management. Investor pricing is <strong>8%</strong> for owners with 3 or more doors.</span></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>New Lease Fee</td>
              <td>Leasing fees are often equal to one full month's rent.</td>
              <td><span class="red-door-answer"><span><strong>$995 flat fee</strong> when Red Door places a new tenant for full-service management.</span></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Vacancy Fee</td>
              <td>Vacancy fees may apply even while rent is not being collected.</td>
              <td><span class="red-door-answer"><span><strong>$0 monthly management fee</strong> while your property is vacant.</span></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Marketing</td>
              <td>Marketing, setup, photos, or showing tools may be separate charges.</td>
              <td><span class="red-door-answer"><span>Professional photos, virtual walkthrough video, listing syndication, and self-guided showing technology are included.</span></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Renewal</td>
              <td>Renewal fees can vary or be unclear until later in the lease cycle.</td>
              <td><span class="red-door-answer"><span><strong>$350 renewal fee</strong> when a tenant renewal is completed.</span></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
